<title>BELGIUM: S.Africa's Evander to get Brussels bourse listing. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Evander to get Brussels bourse listing. [CORRECTED 14:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of South African gold mining company Evander Gold Mines Limited will be listed on the Brussels bourse from April 21 in the form of International Depositary Receipts, the organisers of the listing said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The IDRs will be issued by Soges-Dewaay, an issuing company held by Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) (corrects from Groupe Bruxelles Lambert SA (GBL)) and brokerage Dewaay, Servais.</p>
<p>Evander is South Africa's seventh-biggest gold mine.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
